Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Run, Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 4
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing does not belong to our world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did this thing come out of that rift?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we have to do some research to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to find him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,quick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Find Weslie quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.47,0:01:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,To catch me, they mobilized all their troops like this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.99,0:01:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my wool so precious?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find that guy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.79,0:01:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It was he who ruined our Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What ruined Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t do it at all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be them
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.07,0:01:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hide like this, I will be caught sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.99,0:01:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta get out of here quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.07,0:01:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Children are not allowed to imitate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.72,0:01:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we really want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right, let’s go soon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.03,0:01:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But I’m still scared
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you say that the guard at the side entrance was lax
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:02:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and that is why you wanted to disguise yourself like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be afraid. Go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.67,0:02:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, there’s no one watching over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.83,0:02:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.79,0:02:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.27,0:02:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It turned out to be for delivering Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I’m here to deliver Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, why do you have to stand guard here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.71,0:02:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Something happened in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Be on guard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.43,0:02:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The vacation is all in vain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your hard work
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, I’ve never seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.07,0:02:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,a fake soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Discovered so quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:02:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m kidding
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would be so bold as to pretend to be a soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:02:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a serious crime
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, who would be so bold?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me do a routine check.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be bad if it was found to be empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and help
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The criminal who destroyed Bulala has been found
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.41,0:03:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No more checking
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.81,0:03:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re going to help
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You go in quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so dangerous. It scares me to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.92,0:03:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally came in
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you afraid at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,this experience
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I have experienced it dozens of times in my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.31,0:03:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I be afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could be as brave as you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.10,0:03:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where should we start looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He was caught as Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It will definitely be put in the warehouse
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.61,0:03:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s head to the warehouse
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, this way
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You are really familiar with this place
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,arrive
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That moving Bulala is so disgusting
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually ruined our Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If we catch him, we’ll definitely make him pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The moving Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.21,0:04:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they talking about Weslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If your friend leaves, he can just leave
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.29,0:04:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why destroy Bulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Without Bulala we would be attacked by monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,monster
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.92,0:04:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t you know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Every full moon night
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There will always be a monster coming
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It won’t come until we pay enough Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,so serious
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe Weslie wouldn’t do such a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s find him and ask him clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,are you too hot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s really too crowded
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take a rest
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.51,0:05:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers are coming. Hide quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There are some here too
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too late to pick it up. Run back quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.39,0:05:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find the prisoner there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I hid quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,too heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wants to work overtime to catch this prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m exhausted
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go over there and have a look
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.78,0:06:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s really awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I also just learned that my hands and feet can stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have my legs become shorter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s movement over there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach you to show off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, dear, I haven’t mastered the new skills yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I hid so well and was discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.84,0:06:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The prisoner seems to have escaped back to the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Go catch him quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.43,0:07:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I don’t know what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s finally safe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn’t seem to be chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sp-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.75,0:07:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,ar-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.86,0:07:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,ky
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.34,0:07:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The person who ruined Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know that without Bulala the monster would come?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How many residents’ homes will be destroyed by then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Misunderstanding, I’m not
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to quibble, just take it easy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.13,0:07:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to quibble, just take it easy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.56,0:08:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Turned
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.19,0:08:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some ability
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.07,0:08:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone come here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who destroyed Bulala was in the garden
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.41,0:08:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,believe it or not
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But it’s true that I didn’t destroy Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll prove it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and see everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bulala that everyone paid so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was ruined by this foreigner named Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.18,0:09:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,why did he do this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,yes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.02,0:09:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was pretty good before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be a misunderstanding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,yes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It can’t be a misunderstanding
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We two brothers watched him destroy it with our own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don’t you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.85,0:09:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all the Bulala in the sky is collected
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can we go to get more?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But there’s no way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight is the night of the full moon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don’t hand over Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.93,0:09:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster is coming
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.93,0:09:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that we can only pay tribute to Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to pay Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I took apart all the beds at home
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we live like this in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t even know how to get enough Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all because of the person who ruined Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Please, I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the doll my grandma made for me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.74,0:10:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making trouble. Nothing is more important now than having enough Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to blame it, just blame Weslie who ruined Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,my doll
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you big brother
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.53,0:10:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you are the one who ruined Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:10:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and made everyone become so
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,not done by me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,not him
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.97,0:11:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he didn’t do it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t look at us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.17,0:11:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter who it is anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone’s problems are caused by the monster
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.20,0:11:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try to solve it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.84,0:11:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s a monster that even the king can’t defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to be a hero here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone catch him
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So handsome
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.86,0:11:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,which side are you from
